00:26:58,960 --> 00:26:59,980
Who was doing the right work?

454
00:26:59,980 --> 00:27:01,460
Who should be followed?

455
00:27:01,460 --> 00:27:05,280
Matt talked last week about the variety of giftings.

456
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:07,280
Paul said some, I've given some as apostles, some as prophets.

457
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:10,060
And Matt talked about, I'm sorry, not last week, I guess it was two weeks ago, yeah.

458
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:15,280
For those who missed it here, apostles and prophets, they're looking at the lost.

459
00:27:15,280 --> 00:27:16,000
They're moving quickly.

460
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:16,680
They're showing up.

461
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,320
They're telling the word.

462
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:17,900
They're moving on.

463
00:27:17,900 --> 00:27:19,020
They're acting unilaterally.

464
00:27:19,020 --> 00:27:22,460
Pastors and teachers, they're slow.

465
00:27:22,460 --> 00:27:23,040
They're deliberate.

466
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:24,260
They're working with the church.

467
00:27:24,260 --> 00:27:26,920
They're building up patterns of habit over time.

468
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:30,300
This is how you train your body to live in a sanctified way.

469
00:27:30,300 --> 00:27:32,300
And those two don't feel compatible, right?

470
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:37,040
When the apostle says, I'm going to have a sermon, and the pastor's like, but we have a sermon series, you know.

471
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:40,780
There's a conflict there.

472
00:27:40,780 --> 00:27:47,700
And we work with one another in this effort because it's both people filled with the Spirit,

473
00:27:47,700 --> 00:27:51,120
working in the calling in which they were called to bear fruit in the world.

474
00:27:51,120 --> 00:27:56,220
We've been grafted into Christ, John 15, so that he flows through us and we bear fruit.

475
00:27:56,220 --> 00:27:57,100
What's the nature of fruit?

476
00:27:57,100 --> 00:27:57,860
What makes fruit fruit?

477
00:27:57,860 --> 00:27:59,000
Chris, where are you?

478
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,960
Seeds, yes, right?

479
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:02,480
What's the nature of a seed?

480
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:03,360
It grows new plants.

481
00:28:03,360 --> 00:28:07,960
If we're doing our role, if we're grafted in Christ, we'll know it because we're fruitful,

482
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:09,040
because we grow more fruit.

483
00:28:09,040 --> 00:28:10,860
The mission is to spread disciples.

484
00:28:10,860 --> 00:28:17,160
God called the Levites in, and Christ called the modern church in so he could push us out.

485
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:19,960
You're pulled in to be sanctified, to be pushed out as gifts.

486
00:28:19,960 --> 00:28:24,620
So I'll rephrase this.

487
00:28:24,620 --> 00:28:30,280
Together we will use our giftings faithfully as we walk in unity in our calling to discipleship,

488
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:33,260
walking worthy of the calling in which we were called.

489
00:28:33,260 --> 00:28:37,180
We are called as disciples and gifted back to make more disciples.

490
00:28:38,580 --> 00:28:44,500
And I'm going to give that to you in a very small packet so we can take it with us this week.

491
00:28:44,500 --> 00:28:51,360
And that is, we are called out as disciples and gifted back to make more disciples together.

492
00:28:51,360 --> 00:28:52,940
That's the mission.

493
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:53,700
All right?

494
00:28:55,900 --> 00:29:00,240
I hope you go home and read Ephesians 4, 1, 3, 13 again.

495
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:06,000
I hope you take this phrase in mind, and I hope you look through the Old Testament and discover this in your life.

496
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,440
I'm going to sink in deeply.

497
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:11,120
One of the things we do in unity is communion.

498
00:29:11,120 --> 00:29:20,900
Christ commanded us to carry out the practice of taking him in us as we dwell in him, together.

499
00:29:20,900 --> 00:29:23,300
He talks about, koinonia was the word of it.

500
00:29:23,300 --> 00:29:24,600
We all have shares in this together.

501
00:29:24,600 --> 00:29:25,680
We've all bought into it.

502
00:29:25,940 --> 00:29:28,480
And he talks about the koinonia of communion, where you...
